@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title GET /api/workspace/v1/me/
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
participant "内观 IAM" as IAM
database "用户 Workspace 在 PostgreSQL" as DB
Client -> API: GET /me/
API -> IAM: 读取当前的身份
IAM --> API: UUID + username/name/email
API -> DB: 更新和阅读用户规范
DB --> API: 用户行
note right of API: 没有 outbox / 任务 / 事件
API --> Client: 200 JSON 用户
@enduml
